{"story":{"id":"event-country-1002","title":{"zh":"浪迹星涯：匆匆一瞥","en":"Wanderlust: A Glimpse"},"category":"stories","kind":"event","image":"art/1847c49a9205c90405fe.webp","start":"country.1005","chapters":6,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"科学家的船就在这个星系里——如果没猜错的话。\n\n我们没法通过探测器确定他们的位置，不过他们主动呼叫了我们。把他们的信号接到[Root.Capital.GetName]。","en":"The Researcher's ship is in this system - we think.\n\nWe are unable to lock in their position on sensors, but they are hailing us. Patching them through to [Root.Capital.GetName]."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1","n7"]},"n1":{"doc":"country.1005","parent":"n0","via":{"group":"c5094","hooks":["immediate"],"when":[[[{"type":"flag","scope":"star","name":"scientist_system_1","path":"from","value":true},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"scisys_1","path":"owner","value":false}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"event_chain","arg":"rogue_scientist_1_chain","scope":"owner/has_completed_event_chain_counter","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"counter","arg":"likely_locations_searched","scope":"owner/has_completed_event_chain_counter","value":true},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"completed_rogue_scientist","path":"owner","value":false}]]],"kind":"entry","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:580","triggers":[{"zh":"舰队进入星系时","en":"When a fleet enters a system"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"country.1010","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"country.1005.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:751"},"children":["n3","n4"]},"n3":{"doc":"country.1011","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"country.1010.b","optionIndex":1,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:780"},"children":["n5"]},"n4":{"doc":"country.1012","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"country.1010.c","optionIndex":2,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:785"},"children":["n6"]},"n5":{"doc":"country.1015","parent":"n3","via":{"option":"country.1010.d","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:805"},"children":[]},"n6":{"ref":"n5","doc":"country.1015","parent":"n4","via":{"option":"country.1010.d","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:825"}},"n7":{"doc":"country.1003","parent":"n0","via":{"group":"c5094","hooks":["immediate"],"when":[[[{"type":"flag","scope":"star","name":"scientist_system_1","path":"from","value":true},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"scisys_1","path":"owner","value":false}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"event_chain","arg":"rogue_scientist_1_chain","scope":"owner/has_completed_event_chain_counter","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"counter","arg":"likely_locations_searched","scope":"owner/has_completed_event_chain_counter","value":false}]]],"kind":"entry","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:593","triggers":[{"zh":"舰队进入星系时","en":"When a fleet enters a system"}]},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"country.1005","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"浪迹星涯：匆匆一瞥","en":"Wanderlust: A Glimpse"},"texts":[{"zh":"科学家的船就在这个星系里——如果没猜错的话。\n\n我们没法通过探测器确定他们的位置，不过他们主动呼叫了我们。把他们的信号接到[Root.Capital.GetName]。","en":"The Researcher's ship is in this system - we think.\n\nWe are unable to lock in their position on sensors, but they are hailing us. Patching them through to [Root.Capital.GetName]."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/1847c49a9205c90405fe.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"country.1005.a","label":{"zh":"打开通讯系统。","en":"Open comms."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"country.1010","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:751","story":"event-country-1002"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_2.txt","line":712},"sets":["completed_rogue_scientist_1"],"names":{"Root.Capital.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"country.1010","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"首席科学官","en":"Head of Research"},"texts":[{"zh":"[Root.GetRulerTitle]，鄙人向您传达我们诚挚的问候。\n\n我估计你不是单纯来寒暄问候的吧？","en":"Greetings and salutations, [Root.GetRulerTitle].\n\nI take it this is not a social call?"}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"country.1010.a","label":{"zh":"这是什么意思？","en":"What is the meaning of this?"},"responses":[{"zh":"您应该想问我从[Root.GetName]上消失的事。\n\n我只是离开一小会，仅此而已。我在寻找真实之窗。但显然我并没找到。\n\n它也不在这里。我必须继续我的研究了。不过我可不会带着这些找到的无人机。","en":"I take it you are referring to my disappearance from [Root.GetName] space.\n\nI needed some time away, is all. Well. Rather, I am looking for the Window. And the Window is certainly not there.\n\nIt is not here either. I must continue my search. I will not be bringing these drones I found, though."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"country.1010.b","label":{"zh":"我们可以派船护送你回家。","en":"We can assign ships to escort you home."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"country.1011","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:780","story":"event-country-1002"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"country.1010.c","label":{"zh":"你必须马上返回首都。","en":"You will return to the capital at once."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"country.1012","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:785","story":"event-country-1002"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_2.txt","line":756},"sets":["scientist_probed"],"names":{"Root.GetName":{"zh":"我们的帝国","en":"our empire"},"Root.GetRulerTitle":{"zh":"统治者","en":"ruler"}}},{"id":"country.1011","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"首席科学官","en":"Head of Research"},"texts":[{"zh":"我现在不想回家。\n\n但是，为了表示我的诚意，请收下这些无人机吧，作为我送给[Root.GetName]的礼物。这些无人机是我在这个星系的外围发现的。经过彻底修理过后，我才发现它们根本不适合用作研究探测。","en":"I have no interest in returning home at present.\n\nBut please, as a token of my goodwill, take these drones. A donation to the [Root.GetName]. I found them drifting on the outskirts of this system, and only after extensive repairs did I realize that they are utterly unfit to function as research probes."}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"country.1010.d","label":{"zh":"对话结束了。","en":"This conversation is over."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"country.1015","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:805","story":"event-country-1002"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_2.txt","line":790},"names":{"Root.GetName":{"zh":"我们的帝国","en":"our empire"}}},{"id":"country.1015","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"浪迹星涯：无人机","en":"Wanderlust: The Drones"},"texts":[{"zh":"首席再次神秘地消失了。\n\n不过他们的确留下了一些无人机。这些无人机装备了武器，而且正在启动！","en":"The Chair has vanished, inexplicably, yet again.\n\nHowever, they did leave a number of drones behind, as promised. The drones are armed, and their weapons are powering up!"}],"sections":[],"image":"art/1847c49a9205c90405fe.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"BATTLESTATIONS","label":{"zh":"各战斗单位就位！","en":"Battlestations!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"sets":["scientist_aggressor_probes","scientist_probe_fleet"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_2.txt","line":830}},{"id":"country.1012","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"首席科学官","en":"Head of Research"},"texts":[{"zh":"对不起，我的研究才刚刚开始。使命在召唤我，这是为了科学。\n\n但是，为了表示我的诚意，请收下这些无人机吧，作为我送给[Root.GetName]的礼物。这些无人机是我在这个星系的外围发现的。经过彻底修理过后，我才发现它们根本不适合用作研究探测。","en":"I think not, this is but the beginning. Duty calls, for science, and so on.\n\nBut please, as a token of my goodwill, take these drones. A donation to the [Root.GetName]. I found them drifting on the outskirts of this system, and only after extensive repairs did I realize that they are utterly unfit to function as research probes."}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"country.1010.d","label":{"zh":"对话结束了。","en":"This conversation is over."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"country.1015","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:825","story":"event-country-1002"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_2.txt","line":810},"names":{"Root.GetName":{"zh":"我们的帝国","en":"our empire"}}},{"id":"country.1003","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"浪迹星涯：死胡同","en":"Wanderlust: Dead End"},"texts":[{"zh":"首席科学官并不在这个星系之内。\n\n这一趟要不就彻底是白忙活，要不就是线索早已经断了。","en":"The Research Head is not in this system.\n\nEither the lead was a dud, or the trail has gone cold."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/1847c49a9205c90405fe.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"country.1003.a","label":{"zh":"继续寻找。","en":"We will keep looking."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_2.txt","line":683}}]}